<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Computing energy levels for quantum systems using numerical methods requires solving  matrix equations that become computationally expensive as complexity increases. Machine learning models can approximate these relationships once trained, enabling rapid predictions without recalculating.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
